<title>ESTONIA: TARTU CITY TO ISSUE CPS WORTH 20 MLN KROONS.</title>
<headline>TARTU CITY TO ISSUE CPS WORTH 20 MLN KROONS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tartu city will organise a new 20 million kroon commercial paper issue from June 2, Hoiupank said on Friday.</p>
<p>The new issue will be for six months and has a yield of 8.05 percent, Hassar Kipp of Hoiupank told Reuters.</p>
<p>&quot;The new issue will be to finance a previous 15 million kroons issue that began in 1994 with a term of three years,&quot; Kipp added.</p>
<p>Tartu city's last issue was over subscribed two times.</p>
<p>-- David Mardiste, Tallinn newsroom +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
